	(text "D1 drops ~0.35 V: LEDs see ~11.6 V (WS2815B min 9.5 V).\nU2 dissipates (12-5) V x ~12 mA = ~85 mW.\nJ2 pins 1/4 and 2/3 are bridged on the PCB: the\ndownstream chain current flows only through J2."
