	(text "Per CH572 datasheet (5 V supply): 2.2 uF + 100 nF\non VDD33 and 1.5 k between V5 and VDD33.\nWS2815B VIH(min) = 2.7 V, so the 3.3 V\nGPIO drives DIN directly via R3.\nLog UART: map TXD_1 to PA2. PA3 = spare."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 78 0)
		(effects
